      "children": [
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 26,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Django admin named \"Startr Admin\": `apps.py` + `STARTR_ADMIN_TITLE`, a project's own title wins, login override shows `site_header`; 2 tests (2026-09-28, made in Trellis's subtree; `make startr_push` brings it here)"
        },
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 27,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "The admin skinned from startr.style tokens through Django's own CSS variables (header, links, buttons, tints, dark), the sidebar replaced by the apps and models as tiers in the header, a one-card sign-in; `STARTR_STYLE_URL` for a vendored kit; `STARTR_ADMIN_NAV = False` keeps Django's sidebar (2026-10-17); proof: NavRenderTest, Trellis `admin-skin.cy.js`"
        },
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 28,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Two navs in the package, automatic for any project: `startr_nav_html(\"dock\")` / `{% startr_nav %}` (first four primary pages on a phone, More for the rest) and tiers (apps as groups); `STARTR_NAV_DOCK`, `STARTR_NAV_GROUPS`, `STARTR_NAV_ICONS` refine (2026-10-17)"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 29,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "[MANUALLY] The switch: one setting (`STARTR_BRAND = \"startr\" | \"sage\"`) or a per-project brand blocks file"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 30,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Brand assets ship in the package as static files, one source of truth: the Sage mark (AI-UI commit `228b958`), the Startr mark, favicons"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 31,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Base shell: header mark, footer credit, colours as startr.style tokens on `:root`, light and dark"
        },
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 32,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Colour tokens live upstream in startr.style (1.4.x ships `--primary-tint`, `--good-bg`, `--warn-bg`, `--bad-bg`, `--font-sans`, `--font-mono`); the package maps, never defines (decided 2026-10-17)"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 33,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Block contract unchanged (`title` + `content`); consumers only gain blocks"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 34,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Gold test: Trellis via its subtree (`make startr_pull`); then the submodule consumers `AnatoliHS/Django3.0` (and its frontend-ux path clones) and the `Startr/WEB-Django` template"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 35,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "A generator test asserts the mark and the brand title in the base template"
        }
      ],
